      "height": 310,
      "text": "Reinforced Carbon Sheet | 2026-11-17\nImplemented in server KubeJS; pending /reload and runtime verification.\nMI Electric Mixer: 4 Carbon Fibre Strands + 2 Deathworm Chitin (red, yellow, or white) + 2,000 mB Naphtha (#c:naphtha) -> 4 Reinforced Carbon Sheets.\n32 EU/t, 240 ticks (12 seconds base duration).\nReplaces oritech:refinery/carbonsheet.\nRecipe: 144craft2:oritech/reinforced_carbon_sheet.\nAffects downstream sheet uses, including Advanced Machine Frames and Ultimate Control Circuits."
    },
